	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - M1421\n\nADSBee m1421 dual-band ADS-B module (lib ADSB_Test:PantsForBirds_ADSBee_m1421). RF + support COPIED FROM ADSBee 1421 CARRIER.\nVCC pads 1,4,19,22 = 3V3_M1421 (switched, PM3 ch2). GND pads 6,18,23,25,27,34,36,MP with via stitching.\nUART: TX(21) -> P4 UART3 RX + debugprobe RX. RX(20) <- 74LVC1G157 mux (default P4 TX, debugprobe TX when selected).\nSYNC(28) -> P4 GPIO + LA ch6 (direction TBC). ~SUBG_RESET(17): open-drain from expander + debugprobe + header pin 10.\nJTAG/SWD: TMSC(8)=SWDIO, TCKC(9)=SWCLK, TDO(10), TDI(11) -> debugprobe + 2x5 1.27mm Cortex header (as carrier).\nLEDs: DIO26(15) red, DIO27(16) green (as carrier). DIO23-25, LR_*, COPRO_SPI: test pads only. LR_RF_HF(35): NC.\nRF: SUBG_RF(24) + LR_RF_LF(26) -> SCN-2-11+ combiner (100R across ports) -> ESD7351 -> SMA. Copy carrier CPW geometry."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
